WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.550
- All right, we are back,

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:04.089
and the bummer is the show's almost over.

00:00:04.089 --> 00:00:04.922
I know you're sad.

00:00:04.922 --> 00:00:06.080
But there is good news as well.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.700
I have one more story to make you smile.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.084
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:09.084 --> 00:00:12.231
(upbeat music)

00:00:12.231 --> 00:00:13.920
So imagine you're
driving with your grandma

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.730
and she turns to you and says this.

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:17.660
- [Granddaughter] Just say it again.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.630
- I said, I'm gonna blow your mind.

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:21.592
I want to get a tattoo.

00:00:21.592 --> 00:00:23.197
- [Granddaughter] You
want to get a tattoo?

00:00:23.197 --> 00:00:25.210
- Yeah, I thought something like that.

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:26.043
- [Granddaughter] Yeah?

00:00:26.043 --> 00:00:26.876
- Yeah.

00:00:26.876 --> 00:00:27.710
- [Granddaughter] Okay.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.160
Well, we'll get you a tattoo.

00:00:30.283 --> 00:00:32.530
- I'm gonna blow your mind.

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:33.363
I love her.

00:00:33.363 --> 00:00:36.650
When 82-year-old Judy shared
her plan to get some ink,

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:38.330
her granddaughter could barely believe it,

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:40.360
so she recorded it to post on TikTok.

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:41.831
Just basically for proof.

00:00:41.831 --> 00:00:44.520
I guess TikTokers
couldn't believe it either

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.280
because the video blew up,

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:47.680
but Judy stuck to her word

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.520
and not only did she get a tattoo,

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:50.910
it became a family affair

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:53.880
with seven other relatives
going under the tattoo gun.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:55.250
It's a family affair, I love it.

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:56.890
We have Judy on the line right now

00:00:56.890 --> 00:01:01.200
watching on WPTA at 3:00
PM in Fort Wayne, Indiana.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.523
Hi Judy.

00:01:02.523 --> 00:01:04.023
(audience cheers)

00:01:04.023 --> 00:01:05.430
- Hi Kelly.

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:06.550
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:11.550
So I have to know what made
you want to get a tattoo at 82?

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:15.340
- Well, I read an article
in the Reader's Digest

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:18.010
about an 80-year-old lady

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:21.500
who gave herself a
tattoo for her birthday,

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.280
her 80th birthday.

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:26.760
I thought about that
and it just inspired me.

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:29.657
So I told my girls, I
want to get a tattoo.

00:01:31.052 --> 00:01:33.528
- I love it.

00:01:33.528 --> 00:01:35.570
I love it, it's so random.

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:39.320
So, what did you get and who
else in your family got them?

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:42.093
And by the way, great
face mask in that photo.

00:01:46.343 --> 00:01:50.560
- Well, there was, like
I said, four generations.

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:55.170
Myself, my daughter, my
granddaughter and her wife,

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:58.710
my two great grandsons and their wives.

00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:01.763
And my youngest grandson, Brendan.

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:04.330
He's 10 years old.

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:06.567
He couldn't get a tattoo.

00:02:06.567 --> 00:02:09.570
(audience laughs)

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:12.400
We got a, what do you call that?

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:14.120
It's a musical clef.

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:15.860
- [Kelly] Okay, yeah.

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:18.283
- It's got a heart, a cancer ribbon,

00:02:20.287 --> 00:02:23.140
and it's just in memory
of all of our loved ones

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:27.390
that we've lost and in memory
of everyone, our friends.

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:29.140
Mine is not quite done yet.

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:32.200
I have to go back and
finish it, but I love it.

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:37.130
And like I said, I am so
much inspired by this,

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:40.129
that I'm going to get another
one on my 83rd birthday.

00:02:40.129 --> 00:02:41.471
(audience cheers)

00:02:41.471 --> 00:02:43.517
- I love it.

00:02:43.517 --> 00:02:44.990
It's so great.

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:47.470
My mom, actually, it was later in life,

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:48.660
I feel like she was in her sixties,

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:50.417
but she looked at my sister
and I one day and was like,

00:02:50.417 --> 00:02:51.257
"I think I'm gonna get a tattoo."

00:02:51.257 --> 00:02:53.175
And I was like, what?

00:02:53.175 --> 00:02:55.620
And then we actually did the same thing.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:59.030
My mom got a sun and I have the moon

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:00.330
and my sister's the star.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:03.070
And our moon and star in her sun.

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:04.570
So like we got a tattoo together.

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:06.750
My family did something
similar, so I love this story.

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:07.670
I thought it was so cool.

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:09.380
Anyway, Judy, thank you so much.

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:12.199
I think it's so cool that
you're getting tattoos.

00:03:12.199 --> 00:03:13.610
- Thank you.

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:16.150
- And it's even cooler
than it's with your family

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:18.215
and I'm liking your post right now.

00:03:18.215 --> 00:03:20.200
And Judy, that's not all.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.810
Our season long partner, Pilot Pen

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:24.710
makers of G2, the go-to pen
of The Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:27.400
they want to honor ultimate
achievers, just like you.

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:29.720
So they'll be writing
you a check for $1,000.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:30.732
How's that sound?

00:03:30.732 --> 00:03:31.565
(audience cheers)

00:03:31.565 --> 00:03:32.648
- Oh my gosh.

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:35.203
- Yeah!

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:40.353
You can get so many tattoos
with $1,000 is all I'm saying.

